 reducer已完成。Stable record topology现共享Arc node-index segments并O(1) rebind current SemanticTree；projection、
 anchor-id与list delta在node construction中单次累计。33,512-record incremental semantic tree为2.48 ms，完整
 revision pipeline为4.13 ms。Nonempty heading facts现存于local nodes，稳定count/level topology共享Arc heading-node
 index；10,000-heading body edit的semantic tree为2.75 ms。Analyzer与root aggregate diagnostics现使用segmented
 projection；query-hot exact-start lookup返回borrowed typed view，2,000-record export从约921 ms降至88.5 ms。
 Document exported-summary equality现阻止semantic-equal edit重建dependency context或刷新dependent diagnostics、
 CodeLens与Folding；10,000-task benchmark从无条件27.55 ms降至guarded 4.58 us。Local semantic summary相等且
 source geometry稳定时现直接复用document reducers；10,000-heading等长body edit从2.816 ms降至1.328 ms。剩余工作
 是将added/changed/removed record delta接入workspace publication；differential tests继续覆盖semantic-analysis中尚未验收的reducer
 delta规则。

